<p>
Pablo Murad just showed up in my feed courtesy of <a href="https://planet.emacslife.com/">Planet Emacslife</a>. There were three posts, two of which Sacha has already covered in this week’s <a href="https://sachachua.com/blog/2026/11/2026-11-23-emacs-news/">Emacs News</a>. The third is <a href="https://pablomurad.com/magit-in-depth/">an in-depth tour of Magit</a>.
</p>
<p>
